			"notes": "# GraalBridge v0.8 - First Public Release\n\n## Features\n\n- **Mappings**\n- **TypeScript**\n- **Enhanced Imports**\n- **Multithreading**\n\n## Platform Support\n\n- **Fabric**, **Forge**, **NeoForge** and **Quilt**\n- JsMacros and Minecraft version independent\n- Only runs on Java > 8 for now\n- **Forge** / **NeoForge**: Currently, there are issues with runtime mappings.\n\nTo significantly reduce the file size, remove any unused `libswc4j` binaries inside the JAR."
